  "definition": "Eligibility for Additional Hardship Extensions",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-05-23",
  "historyNote": "#7470, eff 4-1-01; amd by #7918, eff 8-1-03; ss by #9433, eff 4-1-09; amd by #9775, eff 9-1-10; ss by #12182, eff 5-23-17",
